      ]
    },
    {
      "figure_number": 4,
      "path": "/home/hp/btp_avatar/Literature-review-rag/parsed/text_driven_generation/Instructavatar/images/figure_004.png",
      "caption": "Fig. 4: Details of motion generator. To denoise noisy motion latent, firstly we elementwise add the audio feature into it. Then, in each denoising block, we design a two-branch cross-attention module to inject emotion and motion control into the model. Lastly, we also incorporate AU and intensity losses to encourage the model to learn them.",
      "provenance": [
